          "text": "Good morning, private banking, Rachel Lim speaking. Hello, Mr Tan. Have you got a quiet moment to talk?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "CLIENT",
          "text": "Morning, Rachel. Yes, I'm in my office. Calling is easier than fitting in a branch visit between meetings. [[EV_013]] [[EV_014]]"
