          "speaker": "CLIENT",
          "text": "[[EV_015]] [[EV_023]] [[EV_016]] [[EV_018]] [[EV_021]]"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "EMPLOYEE",
          "text": "[[EV_001]] Take your time with the paperwork; there's no rush on my side."
        },
        {
          "speaker": "CLIENT",
          "text": "I've got a few pages spread across my desk. [[EV_019]] [[EV_020]]"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "EMPLOYEE",
          "text": "[[EV_002]] [[EV_003]]"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "CLIENT",
          "text": "[[EV_004]] Hang on, I've found the note I made. [[EV_022]] [[EV_024]]"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "EMPLOYEE",
          "text": "[[EV_005]] [[EV_017]] [[EV_006]] [[EV_012]]"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "CLIENT",
          "text": "I'd rather describe how I actually feel, Rachel, not put on a different tone just for the record."
        },
        {
          "speaker": "EMPLOYEE",
          "text": "[[EV_007]]"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "CLIENT",
          "text": "[[EV_008]]"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "EMPLOYEE",
          "text": "[[EV_009]] [[EV_010]]"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "CLIENT",
